# Token Eyes Tauri self-contained runtime (generated by bundle-runtime.ps1)
# Ignore everything under EmbeddedServer/ except the .gitkeep placeholder so the
# directory exists for Tauri's `resources` glob (`EmbeddedServer/**/*`) at build
# script validation time, even before bundle-runtime.ps1 runs.
src-tauri/EmbeddedServer/*
!src-tauri/EmbeddedServer/.gitkeep

